# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-KPMFK`.
# `env -u ...` because a dispatch leaks its run id and home into subprocesses,
# and these tests build and drive a supervisor that must see neither.
#
# Four tests, because the defect has two halves and the proof needs both:
# three restart tests (one per shared stage path — grill, plan, architect)
# that require the terminal tx a stage live across a daemon restart must still
# emit, and one production-path test that requires the stage identity those
# three depend on to actually be on disk after a real `POST /api/grill`.
#
# The rmux variants only. Their tmux twins are the same assertions on the other
# transport and stay in the suite; they are left out here because a shimmed
# tmux (an orgasmic worker has `tmux` symlinked to `rmux`) makes them skip, and
# a pinned count that changes with the machine pins nothing.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-daemon --lib -- boot_reattach_rmux_respawns_grill_stage_completion_watcher boot_reattach_rmux_respawns_plan_stage_completion_watcher boot_reattach_rmux_respawns_architect_stage_completion_watcher a_launched_stage_persists_its_stage_identity_for_boot_recovery
